  "description": "Availability SLOs (99.9% / rolling 30d) and multi-window burn-rate view for the three public sites, from the lab Alloy blackbox probes (Mimir). Alerting counterpart: terraform/alerts.tf group 'Site SLO burn rate'. See docs/adr/0008.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Sites \u2014 Availability SLOs & Error Budget\n\n**Objective: 99.9% availability over a rolling 30-day window** (43.2 min of allowed downtime / 30d), measured from the lab Alloy's outside-in blackbox probes (`probe_success` \u2192 Mimir).\n\n**Burn rate** = (fraction of failed probes over the window) \u00f7 0.001. A burn rate of **1** exactly exhausts the month's budget in 30 days; **14.4** exhausts it in ~50h. Alerts (see `terraform/alerts.tf`, group *Site SLO burn rate*): **fast-burn pages** at \u226514.4 (1h \u2227 5m), **slow-burn tickets** at \u22653 (24h \u2227 2h).\n\nThree public sites only \u2014 essexcrossingatmontserrat.com shares pondviewlane's ECS service, and the claytonia queue SLO is tracked in #200."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "title": "lentago.dev",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLO attainment (30d)",
      "description": "Fraction of successful probes over the rolling 30-day window. Target 99.9%.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.999
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.9995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "avg_over_time(probe_success{job=\"integrations/blackbox/lentago.dev\"}[30d])"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error budget remaining",
      "description": "Share of the 30-day error budget still unspent: 1 - (failed fraction / 0.001). 100% = untouched, 0% = exhausted, negative = over budget (SLO missed).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - (1 - avg_over_time(probe_success{job=\"integrations/blackbox/lentago.dev\"}[30d])) / 0.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
